                "loc": "ACT.19.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 19.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2JN.1.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Jn 1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " The elder to the beloved Gaius, whom I love in the truth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beloved, I pray that all may go well with you and that you may be in health; I know that it is well with your soul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I greatly rejoiced when some of the brethren arrived and testified to the truth of your life, as indeed you do follow the truth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No greater joy can I have than this, to hear that my children follow the truth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beloved, it is a loyal thing you do when you render any service to the brethren, especially to strangers, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "who have testified to your love before the church. You will do well to send them on their journey as befits God's service. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they have set out for his sake and have accepted nothing from the heathen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So we ought to support such men, that we may be fellow workers in the truth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have written something to the church; but Diotrephes, who likes to put himself first, does not acknowledge my authority. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So if I come, I will bring up what he is doing, prating against me with evil words. And not content with that, he refuses himself to welcome the brethren, and also stops those who want to welcome them and puts them out of the church.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beloved, do not imitate evil but imitate good. He who does good is of God; he who does evil has not seen God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.21.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 21.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Demetrius has testimony from every one, and from the truth itself; I testify to him too, and you know my testimony is true.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2JN.1.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Jn 12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " I had much to write to you, but I would rather not write with pen and ink; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hope to see you soon, and we will talk together face to face.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "3JN 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Peace be to you. The friends greet you. Greet the friends, every one of them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "3JN.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "3JN.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
